{"id":"4d392f39bfd06262","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-m-completeness-of-k.md","title":"m-Completeness of K","display":"thm-m-completeness-of-k — m-Completeness of K","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-m-completeness-of-k","aliases":["68-thm-m-completeness-of-k"],"display":"thm-m-completeness-of-k — m-Completeness of K","depends_on":["[[68-df-halting-set]]","[[68-df-m-completeness]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14 p.49 diagonal set; §16 example p.59 / PDF 58,68","verification_status":"source-adapted-theorem","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-m-completeness-of-k"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-m-completeness-of-k</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-m-completeness-of-k — m-Completeness of K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5afd25b07b64f3c2\" href=\"?note=5afd25b07b64f3c2\" title=\"68-df-m-completeness\">68-df-m-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" href=\"?note=3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" title=\"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem\">68-thm-s-m-n-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14 p.49 diagonal set; §16 example p.59 / PDF 58,68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-theorem"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE},W_e\">\\(\\mathrm{RE},W_e\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。参数定理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" href=\"?note=3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" title=\"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem\">68-thm-s-m-n-theorem</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}(K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{mComplete}(K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §14，印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58，将 K 记作 D；§16，印刷 p.59 / PDF p.68，给出通用 RE 关系的完备性。此处将其落实到目录的对角集合 K：K 由统一停机谓词的对角代入可见是 RE。若 B=W_e，参数定理给出全递归 h，使 φ_(h(x))(z)≃φ_e(x) 对所有 z 成立，于是 x∈B↔φ_(h(x))(h(x))↓↔h(x)∈K。故任意 RE 集 many-one 归约于 K。本地对角归约证明已复核；并未把原书未命名的本地标题冒充书中定理名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-m-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5afd25b07b64f3c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-m-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$、$\\mathrm{mComplete}$、$\\mathrm{RE},W_e$ 见所列直接依赖。参数定理见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE},W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}(K).","display":true}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-m-completeness-of-k]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-m-completeness-of-k|thm-m-completeness-of-k — m-Completeness of K]]"}],"outgoing":["eab12566d8ac44ad","5afd25b07b64f3c2","913d52943499d039","3b8f02ef6e351ea3"]}